  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Found amidst the ruins of a forgotten skate park, 'Vice' was once a street medic, patching up fellow skaters after gnarly spills. Now, he uses his rusty medical knowledge and bone-dry demeanor to patch up (or more often, patch over) his fellow flock members, always muttering about the good old days when DRIP flowed freely at the park fountain.",
    "class": "Wasteland Medic",
    "name": "Vice Grip 'Vice' Quackers",
    "personality": "Deadpan, pragmatic, and a little unhinged. Vice never cracks a smile, even when dispensing questionable medical advice. He's fiercely loyal to his flock, but mostly because they're the only ones who can tolerate his morbid sense of humor and toxic bedside manner. Hiding a kind quacking heart, that no one dares to approach.",
